The FDA may also impose requirements for costly post-marketing studies or clinical trials and surveillance to
monitor the safety or efficacy of the product, including the adoption and implementation of risk evaluation and mitigation
strategies. The FDA and other agencies, including the Department of Justice, or the DOJ, closely regulate and monitor the
